      "team": "オリオールズ",
      "outlet": "Baltimore Banner",
      "text": "If I’m Trevor Rogers, I’m walking into meetings from here on out saying, “Give me half of Skubal’s deal” just to see what happens",
      "likes": 42,
      "reposts": 1,
      "replies": 2,
      "at": "2026-11-22T22:21:52.702Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:licyksm72ljqiq4oxbwxu2mi/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2wnnrqxlk2v",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "もし自分がトレバー・ロジャースなら、これからは会議のたびに「スクバルの契約の半分をくれ」と言って、どうなるか試してみるね"
    },
    {
      "handle": "nightengalejr.bsky.social",
      "author": "Bobby Nightengale",
      "team": "ツインズ",
      "outlet": "Star Tribune",
      "text": "Royce Lewis penned a farewell post on his Instagram: “I am at a loss for words to describe what the Minnesota Twins, the fans, the staff and the state have meant to me these last 9 years.”",
      "likes": 36,
      "reposts": 2,
      "replies": 2,
      "at": "2026-11-22T00:42:13.705Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:gtt6sqfv2lck4wxdxymmhrxk/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2uezt6y7k2a",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ロイス・ルイスがInstagramに別れの投稿。「この9年間、ミネソタ・ツインズ、ファン、スタッフ、そしてこの州が自分にとってどれほどの存在だったか、言葉が見つからない」"
    },
    {
      "handle": "timbhealey.bsky.social",
      "author": "Tim Healey",
      "team": "レッドソックス",
      "outlet": "Boston Globe",
      "text": "The Red Sox are interested in Luis Gil, source says. Nontendered by Yankees, Gil was the 2024 AL ROY. Lat + shoulder issues cost him much of 2025-26; he is pitching in DR this offseason. Red Sox could stand to add to rotation depth in some form, especially after Oviedo trade.",
      "likes": 21,
      "reposts": 3,
      "replies": 4,
      "at": "2026-11-22T17:04:15.446Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:xkzamczb4qhnr2gfh4alpesa/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2w3vtdpy22t",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "Please don’t sign another injured player.",
          "likes": 2,
          "author": "gioeuro.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "That would actually explain the Oveido deal.",
          "likes": 1,
          "author": "oldtimer75.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Sounds like the Red Sox\nSucker for injured pitchers",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "rreardon.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Fine gamble in a vacuum, but with all of our MLB level depth consisting of injured guys (Houck, Crawford), this would seem a bit fraught.  A better fit would seem a lower ceiling, but reliable arm.  Or better yet, just spend some money and get Gaussman or equivalent",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "v1tc.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "レッドソックスがルイス・ヒルに関心と情報筋。ヤンキースにノンテンダーとなった2024年のア・リーグ新人王。広背筋と肩の故障で2025-26年の多くを失い、今オフはドミニカで投げている"
    },
